  "title": "Thinking about moving? Don\u2019t wait for the perfect job.",
  "date": "2025-11-12T15:33:25.953Z",
  "content": {
    "text": "96\n\n Thinking about moving? Don\u2019t wait for the perfect job.\nHi Sara,\nNot everyone relocates for a job.\nSome people buy the job so they can relocate.\nI work with a lot of accountants who\u2019ve built solid careers, but want a change.\u00a0\nSmaller town. Closer to family. Slower pace.\nThe challenge? Those dream locations don\u2019t usually come with dream job offers.\nSo they buy the firm.\nA small accounting practice\n\nWith an existing team\n\nAn office chair that\u2019s already worn in!\n\nAnd enough margin to support their lifestyle from day one\n\nNo five-year ramp-up. No late-night scrambling for clients living in your parents\u2019 basement.\nJust a business that pays, in a place they actually want to be.\nIt\u2019s not about skipping hard work. It\u2019s about not having to start from scratch when you don\u2019t have time (or patience) for that anymore.\nIf you could move anywhere and be your own boss, where would it be?\nHit reply - I\u2019d love to hear where your head goes.\nSara Sharp\nDeal Attorney & Founder, Deal Academy\n\n For more helpful lessons from Deal Academy, check out our Dealmakers Youtube Channel where you'll find Sara's Weekly Wine Down, where she talks about what she's seen in the industry this week and interviews with M&A Experts and Dealmakers.\nYou can check out some recent Dealmakers YouTube videos by clicking the images below.\n\n Copyright \u00a9 2025\u00a0 Someday Consultants, All rights reserved. \n\n Our e-mail address is:\ninfo@dealacademy.org\n\n Want to change how you receive these emails?\n You can unsubscribe from this list.",
