px;\" ><![endif]-->\n            \n      <div class=\"mj-column-per-100 mj-outlook-group-fix\" style=\"font-size:0px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;\">\n        \n      <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\">\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"vertical-align:top;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;\">\n              \n    <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"\" width=\"100%\">\n          <tbody>\n            \n                      \n                    <tr>\n                    <td align=\"center\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:10px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:20px;word-break:break-word;\">\n                      \n      <p style=\"border-top:solid 2px rgba(242, 247, 250, 1);font-size:1px;margin:0px auto;width:100%;\">\n      </p>\n      \n      <!--[if mso | IE]><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-top:solid 2px rgba(242, 247, 250, 1);font-size:1px;margin:0px auto;width:520px;\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"520px\" ><tr><td style=\"height:0;line-height:0;\"> &nbsp;\n</td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n    \n    \n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                    \n                    \n                      \n                    <tr>\n                    <td align=\"left\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:24px;word-break:break-word;\">\n                      \n      <div style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.25;text-align:left;color:#000000;\"><h2 style=\"margin-top: 14pt;margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 18px\">Thinking about moving? Don\u2019t wait for the perfect job.</span></h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\">Hi </span>Sara,</p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Not everyone relocates <em>for</em> a job.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Some people buy the job so they can relocate.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">I work with a lot of accountants who\u2019ve built solid careers, but want a change.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Smaller town. Closer to family. Slower pace.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">The challenge? Those dream locations don\u2019t usually come with dream job offers.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">So they buy the firm.</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top: 0;margin-bottom: 0;padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li style=\"list-style-type: disc;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color: transparent;font-weight: 400;font-style: normal;font-variant: normal;text-decoration: none;vertical-align: baseline;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">A small accounting practice</span></p></li><li style=\"list-style-type: disc;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color: transparent;font-weight: 400;font-style: normal;font-variant: normal;text-decoration: none;vertical-align: baseline;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt;margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">With an existing team</span></p></li><li style=\"list-style-type: disc;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color: transparent;font-weight: 400;font-style: normal;font-variant: normal;text-decoration: none;vertical-align: baseline;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt;margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">An office chair that\u2019s already worn in!</span></p></li><li style=\"list-style-type: disc;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color: transparent;font-weight: 400;font-style: normal;font-variant: normal;text-decoration: none;vertical-align: baseline;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">And enough margin to support their lifestyle from day one</span></p></li></ul><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">No five-year ramp-up. No late-night scrambling for clients living in your parents\u2019 basement.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Just a business that pays, in a place they actually want to be.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">It\u2019s not about skipping hard work. It\u2019s about not having to start from scratch when you don\u2019t have time (or patience) for that anymore.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">If you could move anywhere and be your own boss, where would it be?</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Hit reply - I\u2019d love to hear where your head goes.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Sara Sharp<br>Deal Attorney &amp; Founder, Deal Academy</span></p></div>\n    \n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                    \n                    \n                      \n                    <tr>\n                    <td align=\"left\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:2